<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sociedad Fomento.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sociedad Fomento.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst Frederick W. Searby confirmed he raised his rating on Desc Sociedad de Fomento Industrial SA de CV to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Desc's lower leverage and enormous upside in the auto parts division enthuse us.  We attribute the record weakness in Desc's stock to a devaluing peso, but point out that Desc with its mostly dollar-denominated revenue stream is to a large degree a beneficiary of peso devaluation,&quot; Searby said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/2 at 19-3/4 on the NYSE.</p>
</text>
